<pb n="3"/><lb n="2a2"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex031012026-09-1003-18-39" status="reviewed">dngos su brda' sprad par bya ba ni don spyi ste | dbang po'i bya ba med pa la | sgra'i don ni mthong pa bzhin | yul dang dus dang rnam pa la phyed mi gsal bar snang pa'o || 
zhen nas brda' sprad par bya ba ni phal cher don rang gi mtshan nyid de | yul dus °°
<lb n="2a3"/>
phyed gsal bar snang pa'o || phal cher don rang mtshan yin zer ba de phal chung pa la rtog med 'khrul pa'i dmigs pa yang zhen pa'i brjod bya yin pa'i phyir ro || 
<rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3864">skyabs</rs> <rs type="school">sems tsam pa</rs>s de'ang shes pa'i rang mtshan yin zer | </seg><gap reason="omitted"/>


   

<pb n="4"/><lb n="2b4"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex083012026-09-1412-26-55" status="reviewed"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:4242">rog</rs> na re shes par bya rgyu'am rtogs par bya rgyu'am gtan la dbab rgyu 1 brjod bya ¦ shes par byed pa sogs rjod byed zer te rtags la khyab ches <expan>gsung ngo</expan> || 
rtse <lb n="2b5"/> khyad par la skyon mi yong bas <expan>mtshan nyid</expan> byas na skyon yong ngo gsung ngo || </seg><gap reason="omitted"/>














